      "id": 476943,
      "username": "pvanthony",
      "name": "P V Anthony",
      "created_at": "2025-08-10T15:57:43.987Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Did I do something wrong on my setting?</p>\n<p>If a user is a “customer” and a “website user”, the user type becomes “system user” instead of “website user”.</p>\n<p>I would like it to be “website user”.</p>\n<p>How can this be done? To remain as type “website user” when the role “website user” and “customer” is ticked.</p>\n<p>Did I miss some setting?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/pvanthony/{size}/14762_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "like_count": null,
